00:16:45,660 --> 00:16:48,484
There's no escape, so you
might as well give up.

256
00:16:48,820 --> 00:16:52,460
Stone Ocean's threat is finding
its way inside the dragon.

257
00:16:53,580 --> 00:16:55,286
