261
00:17:10,980 --> 00:17:12,440
Yes, I won

262
00:17:14,340 --> 00:17:16,017
Bow down before me.

263
00:17:16,100 --> 00:17:19,300
There's no change in
reviving the founder either

264
00:17:32,100 --> 00:17:32,930
Hey!

265
00:17:33,013 --> 00:17:34,557
I hit her, didn't I, Drake's dream?

266
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,357
