286
00:18:40,980 --> 00:18:44,627
And I told you, you're the one
drifting away from me, old man.

287
00:18:44,740 --> 00:18:45,820
I can't help you.

288
00:18:46,060 --> 00:18:49,600
By the way, about your legs,
they look very strange.

289
00:18:50,040 --> 00:18:52,197
