294
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:08,275
Could it possibly be?

295
00:19:08,500 --> 00:19:11,377
The stand that's emerging
from inside Jolene is...

296
00:19:11,460 --> 00:19:15,300
Dive or drive, and I insured
