308
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:10,520
That goes for me, too,

309
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:15,214
because of the stand that made the
prisoners and guards fight each other.

310
00:20:15,560 --> 00:20:16,390
Although...

311
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:20,160
Ahhhh!

312
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:23,560
Ahhhh!

313
00:20:28,460 --> 00:20:29,420
Ahhhh!

314
00:20:30,320 --> 00:20:33,080
