Your safe direction is northeast,
and your lucky color, cerulean blue.

326
00:21:10,080 --> 00:21:13,677
But I must inform you,
you're all out of chances.

327
00:21:13,760 --> 00:21:19,420
In only a few minutes of battle,
you've aged exponentially further.

328
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:48,937
Although you think I cope,

329
00:21:49,020 --> 00:21:54,677
my head is filled with hope.

330
00:21:54,760 --> 00:21:59,597
Of some place

331
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:02,680
