335
00:22:18,580 --> 00:22:22,280
About my destiny!

336
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:28,340
I'm thinking about,

337
00:22:30,660 --> 00:22:36,937
All the things I'd

338
00:22:37,020 --> 00:22:43,640
