a lot of pain suddenly.

346
00:23:16,700 --> 00:23:18,780
But we need to find them now.

347
00:23:19,140 --> 00:23:20,199
You know the bone?

348
00:23:20,380 --> 00:23:22,137
And the little guy that picked it up?

349
00:23:22,220 --> 00:23:24,400
Just wait a few minutes.

350
00:23:24,800 --> 00:23:26,760
